        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 11:2",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Saying, Thou wentest in to men uncircumcised, and didst eat with them.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 11:3",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "But Peter rehearsed the matter from the beginning, and expounded it by order unto them, saying,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 20,
            "end": 30
          },
          {
            "start": 65,
            "end": 67
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 4,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 11:4",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "I was in the city of Joppa praying: and in a trance I saw a vision, A certain vessel descend, as it had been a great sheet, let down from heaven by four corners; and it came even to me:",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 45,
            "end": 51,
            "text": "Acts 22:17."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Acts 22:17.",
            "prettyString": "Acts 22:17",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "acts",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 22,
                    "end": 22,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 17,
                        "end": 17
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 11:5",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "Upon the which when I had fastened mine eyes, I considered, and saw fourfooted beasts of the earth, and wild beasts, and creeping things, and fowls of the air.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 11:6",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "And I heard a voice saying unto me, Arise, Peter; slay and eat.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 11:7",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "But I said, Not so, Lord: for nothing common or unclean hath at any time entered into my mouth.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 11:8",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "But the voice answered me again from heaven, What God hath cleansed, that call not thou common.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 59,
            "end": 67,
            "text": "TG Purification; Uncleanness."
          },
          {
            "start": 88,
            "end": 94,
            "text": "Acts 10:15 (3, 15)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 69,
            "end": 73
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Purification; Uncleanness.",
            "prettyString": "TG Purification; TG Uncleanness",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
                "studyHelpType": "tg",
