              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
                "studyHelpType": "tg",
                "title": "Uncleanness",
                "entryId": "tg-uncleanness",
                "book": "",
                "chapters": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 11:9",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "And this was done three times: and all were drawn up again into heaven.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 11:10",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "And, behold, immediately there were three men already come unto the house where I was, sent from Cæsarea unto me.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 11:11",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "And the Spirit bade me go with them, nothing doubting. Moreover these six brethren accompanied me, and we entered into the man’s house:",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 11:12",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "And he shewed us how he had seen an angel in his house, which stood and said unto him, Send men to Joppa, and call for Simon, whose surname is Peter;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 13,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 11:13",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
        "text": "Who shall tell thee words, whereby thou and all thy house shall be saved.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 14,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 11:14",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 14
      },
      {
        "text": "And as I began to speak, the Holy Ghost fell on them, as on us at the beginning.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 15,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 11:15",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 15
      },
      {
        "text": "Then remembered I the word of the Lord, how that he said, John indeed baptized with water; but ye shall be baptized with the Holy Ghost.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 16,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 11:16",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 16
      },
      {
        "text": "Forasmuch then as God gave them the like gift as he did unto us, who believed on the Lord Jesus Christ; what was I, that I could withstand God?",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 41,
            "end": 45,
            "text": "TG Holy Ghost, Gift of; Holy Ghost, Gifts of."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 49,
            "end": 55
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 17,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Holy Ghost, Gift of; Holy Ghost, Gifts of.",
            "prettyString": "TG Holy Ghost, Gift of; TG Holy Ghost, Gifts of",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
                "studyHelpType": "tg",
                "title": "Holy Ghost, Gift of",
                "entryId": "tg-holy-ghost-gift-of",
