            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 11:22",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 22
      },
      {
        "text": "Who, when he came, and had seen the grace of God, was glad, and exhorted them all, that with purpose of heart they would cleave unto the Lord.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 23,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 11:23",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 23
      },
      {
        "text": "For he was a good man, and full of the Holy Ghost and of faith: and much people was added unto the Lord.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 24,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 11:24",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 24
      },
      {
        "text": "Then departed Barnabas to Tarsus, for to seek Saul:",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 25,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 11:25",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 25
      },
      {
